    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like there is literally nothing left of me. everything i spent my whole life building, all those years of studying and the research and the everything... it’s just gone. i don't even know who i am if i'm not that person anymore. it feels like i'm just a ghost walking around.",
